	"Description": "S21 live-ops spine: the Battle Pass season definition, tier/reward model, XP curve, and the server-authoritative per-player progress component. A plain Default-phase RUNTIME plugin, not a GameFeature, for the same load-order reason AFLCosmeticCore is one: UAFLPassSeasonAsset registers as an AssetManager primary-asset type and AssetManager scans PrimaryAssetTypesToScan at engine startup, before any GameFeature module loads. The reward ASSETS a season points at stay soft-referenced and load on demand; only the season/tier vocabulary needs to be early. Pricing is NOT here and never will be: the pass is $5/month real money (IRONICS_PRICING_SSOT), entitlement lives on the existing conditional/counted paths, and duplicating a price into a data asset is how a superseded number survives.",
